# [[.Name]]

A Weft app: Go and Vue in one binary. Theme: [[.Theme]].

```sh
weft dev      # run it while you work
weft build    # build the pages and the binary
```

The pages are in `web/pages`, the Go API in `app` (one folder per module, listed in `app/modules.go`: `data`, which keeps the records in SQLite, `auth`, the owner's login, and `hello`); the settings are in `.env`, which `.env.sample` explains. Set `AUTH_OWNER_EMAIL` in `.env` to the owner's email; at the first start the app logs a link, `/setup#token=…`, that sets the owner's password. Weft's docs are at https://weft.base.al. An agent starts from https://weft.base.al/index.md, then https://weft.base.al/llms.txt.
